    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A piece written once and made in whatever key it is wanted was a" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// `template piece`. What was reusable about it is its *material* — a function" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// of a key and a collection returning an event track — and that is ordinary" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// source any number of pieces may import and call. The piece itself never was" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// reusable, because a file is one piece however the piece got there" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// (docs/rules/language/01-surface.md §6)." },
